    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Benefits"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "The Resolution Platform that scales with you"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Elevate experiences with self-learning AI"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Enable agentic service that builds loyalty across all channels. Self-learning AI agents can automate up to 80% of interactions, improving with every resolution while keeping responses accurate and on brand."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Accelerate issue resolution"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Optimize support operations with intelligent automation, customizable workflows, and a knowledge base that empowers human and AI agents to boost productivity and scale with your business."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Continuously optimize with data and insights"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Transform customer and operational data into AI-powered analytics, and gain visibility into key metrics such as omnichannel live monitoring, automation potential, and predictive insights."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Secure control that builds customer trust"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Boost customer confidence with reliable, secure, and compliant service that gives you complete control over complex support operations and protects your brand reputation."
    }
   ],
